Vendored source code
--------------------

This service includes code derived from RapidOCR v3.10.0
(https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR, tag v3.10.0, commit
bd941dae09da793e76c6ba15c7aaf40f8424232a), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:

    Copyright (c) 2021 RapidOCR Authors. All rights reserved.

RapidOCR's DB text-detection post-processing and CTC decoding are themselves derived
from PaddleOCR (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0:

    Copyright (c) 2020 PaddlePaddle Authors. All Rights Reserved.

The derived files, each changed by the OpenVerify authors as its header describes:

    src/openverify_vision/ocr/geometry.py
        from python/rapidocr/ch_ppocr_det/utils.py (get_mini_boxes, unclip,
        order_points_clockwise) and python/rapidocr/utils/process_img.py
        (get_rotate_crop_image); unclip is rewritten with OpenCV and NumPy in place of
        pyclipper and shapely.
    src/openverify_vision/ocr/detection.py
        from python/rapidocr/ch_ppocr_det/main.py and utils.py (DetPreProcess,
        DBPostProcess, sorted_boxes) and python/rapidocr/utils/process_img.py
        (resize_image_within_bounds, map_boxes_to_original); defaults from
        python/rapidocr/config.yaml.
    src/openverify_vision/ocr/recognition.py
        from python/rapidocr/ch_ppocr_rec/main.py (resize_norm_img, batching) and
        python/rapidocr/ch_ppocr_rec/utils.py (CTCLabelDecode).

RapidOCR ships no NOTICE file of its own. The rapidocr package itself is not a
dependency of this service.


Derived source code (Phase 4)
-----------------------------

These files derive from Apache-2.0 work, each changed by the OpenVerify authors as its
header describes:

    src/openverify_vision/liveness.py
        reimplements the passive anti-spoofing preprocessing and fusion of
        Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing (https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing,
        commit b6d5f04ad78778917853b25c778acef6d5626d15), licensed under the Apache License,
        Version 2.0:

            Copyright 2020 Minivision

        from src/generate_patches.py (CropImage._get_new_box, CropImage.crop),
        src/data_io/functional.py (to_tensor), and src/anti_spoof_predict.py and test.py (the
        softmax and the fusion of the two models). Rewritten with NumPy and OpenCV, without
        PyTorch; the models run as ONNX, the 3:4 frame upstream requires is not, and the
        effective crop scales are reported. The YuNet box transform is new.

    src/openverify_vision/pose.py
        CANONICAL_LANDMARKS_CM are five points derived from MediaPipe's canonical face mesh
        (https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe, commit
        a908d668c730da128dfa8d9f6bd25d519d006692,
        mediapipe/modules/face_geometry/data/canonical_face_model.obj), licensed under the
        Apache License, Version 2.0:

            Copyright 2020 The MediaPipe Authors

        The eye centres are the midpoints of vertices 33/133 and 362/263, the nose tip is
        vertex 1 and the mouth corners are vertices 61 and 291, rounded to four decimals. The
        rest of the module is new. The mesh file itself is not part of this distribution.

Neither repository ships a NOTICE file of its own at these commits.


Models loaded at runtime (not part of this source distribution)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The service loads, but does not bundle, these model files. scripts/fetch_models.py
downloads them into models/, each pinned by commit and SHA-256 in models/manifest.json.
The copyright in the model weights belongs to Baidu and the PaddlePaddle Authors
(PaddleOCR); the model cards declare the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    PP-OCRv6 small text detection (ONNX)
        https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_small_det_onnx
        commit 28fe5895c24fd108c19eb3e8479f4ab385fbfc62, file inference.onnx
    PP-OCRv6 small text recognition (ONNX) and its inference.yml (character dictionary)
        https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_small_rec_onnx
        commit b8f84f0b80c529de40b4fbb3544b84fa7233a513, files inference.onnx and
        inference.yml

The face models the service also loads are listed, with their licences, in
models/manifest.json and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md at the root of the repository.


