8076, 156.0.8076.0, from pdfium-binaries, MIT, Copyright 2014-2025 Benoit Blanchon), and reads
PDF metadata with pypdf 6.21.4 (BSD-3-Clause). Both are used unmodified, and each wheel carries
its licence files in its dist-info directory. These notices are given because the components
compiled into PDFium, or shipped inside pypdf, ask for them:

